docs {
  This request is obsolete and intentionally left disabled — do not run it.

  The endpoint no longer supports updated_after/cursor sync — it is now a lookup by agent
  email (see "List Conversations" and "Get Conversation Detail" in this folder, and
  docs/crm-integration.md). This file is kept only as a pointer for anyone who bookmarked the
  old request; ask a maintainer to delete it next time the collection is cleaned up.
}
